      "DGP                 Initial CE Loss     Final CE Loss       CE Improvement      KL Bayes ImprovementAvg Info Gain       \n",
      "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "Uniform i.i.d.      2.393               2.392               0.001               -0.013              0.110               \n",
      "Multinomial i.i.d.  2.364               2.019               0.345               -0.178              0.504               \n",
